-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the original work in this repository: the build
scripts, the drop-rate implementations, the browser app, and the data files
those scripts produce from the game's own code.

It does not, and cannot, cover the following, which are included for the tool
to function but belong to others:

  Game assets (dropcalc/assets/)
      Sprites, map artwork and item icons extracted from Inflation RPG. These
      are the property of the game's author and are redistributed here only so
      the tool can display what it describes. They are not licensed by this
      project, and the MIT grant above does not extend to them.

  Enemy names (enemy_names.json, wiki/EnemyBlock.wiki)
      Taken from the Inflation RPG Fandom wiki, which publishes under
      CC BY-SA 3.0. The game itself names no enemy; these names are the
      community's work. Those two files carry the wiki's licence, not this
      one -- reuse them under CC BY-SA 3.0, with attribution to
      https://inflation-rpg.fandom.com/wiki/Template:EnemyBlock

Everything else -- the formula transcription, the parsers, the map
reconstruction and the app itself -- was derived from the decompiled game code
by this project.
